message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "FONDA workflow-run publisher for VIVO"
authors:
  - family-names: Kati
    given-names: Yagmur
repository-code: "https://github.com/YagmurKati/fonda-vivo-run-publisher"
url: "https://github.com/YagmurKati/fonda-vivo-run-publisher"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Collects and publishes metadata of finished scientific workflow runs to
  FONDA VIVO, including execution provenance, resource use, energy measurements,
  carbon estimates, and links to workflows, researchers, data, and infrastructure.
keywords:
  - FONDA
  - VIVO
  - scientific workflows
  - metadata
  - provenance
